  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Facilidad de Energa Sostenible(FES) para el Caribe Oriental</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Energy Facility (SEF) for the Eastern Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Banco proporcionar un GCL al CDB para financiar subprstamos elegibles en todos los pases beneficiarios de acuerdo a los siguientes componentes del SEF: a) Componente 1: Eficiencia Energtica; b) Componente 2: Marco regulatorio, fortalecimiento institucional y desarrollo de capacidades; y c) Componente 3: Energa Renovable.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Bank will provide a Global Credit Loan to the Caribbean Development Bank (CDB), which would on-lend the resources to finance eligible sub-loans in all beneficiary countries according to the following SEF components: a) Component 1: Energy Efficiency; b) Component 2: Regulatory framework, institutional strengthening and capacity building; and c) Component 3: Renewable Energy</narrative>
  </description>
